From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 05:59:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD route selected-agent slash commands through backend
 hooks

Slash-token chat messages for a selected agent are backend-native commands, so they bypass normal prompt sending and title generation while still streaming through the selected session. Codex resumes the existing thread with the raw command stdin, preserving launch-time policy context without reinjecting it.
